        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle CU 27 – Filtrando por puntaje (Error)\n\nactor Cliente as C\nboundary \&quot;V_Reportes\&quot; as VRep\ncontrol \&quot;C_stats_bp (Negocio)\&quot; as C_stats_bp\ncontrol \&quot;C_api (Gateway)\&quot; as API\ncontrol \&quot;C_stats (Backend)\&quot; as C_stats\ndatabase \&quot;PostgreSQL\&quot; as DB\n\nC -&gt; VRep: abrirReportePuntajes()\nVRep -&gt; C_stats_bp: filtrarPorPuntaje(filtros, criterio)\n\nalt Criterio inválido\n  C_stats_bp --&gt; VRep: mostrarError(\&quot;Criterio debe ser &#39;mayor&#39; o &#39;menor&#39;.\&quot;)\n  return\nelse OK\nend\n\nC_stats_bp -&gt; API: GET /api/stats/puntajes?...\nAPI -&gt; C_stats: filtrarPuntajes(...)\n\nalt Sin datos\n  C_stats -&gt; DB: SELECT ... ORDER BY puntaje\n  DB --&gt; C_stats: 0 filas\n  C_stats --&gt; API: 204\n  API --&gt; C_stats_bp: 204\n  C_stats_bp --&gt; VRep: mostrarAviso(\&quot;No hay puntajes para mostrar.\&quot;)\nelse Error consulta\n  C_stats -&gt; DB: SELECT ...\n  DB --&gt; C_stats: ERROR\n  C_stats --&gt; API: 500\n  API --&gt; C_stats_bp: 500\n  C_stats_bp --&gt; VRep: mostrarError(\&quot;Error al filtrar por puntaje.\&quot;)\nend\n\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;format&quot;: &quot;svg&quot;&#xa;}" id="EdemnlwTF5HKD6mCVPMw-1">
