        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle CU 28 – Reportando por cantidad de respuestas por programa (Auditoría) (Error)\n\nactor Cliente as C\nboundary \&quot;V_Auditoria\&quot; as VAud\ncontrol \&quot;C_stats_bp (Negocio)\&quot; as C_stats_bp\ncontrol \&quot;C_api (Gateway)\&quot; as API\ncontrol \&quot;C_stats (Backend)\&quot; as C_stats\ndatabase \&quot;PostgreSQL\&quot; as DB\n\nC -&gt; VAud: abrirRespuestasAuditoria()\nVAud -&gt; C_stats_bp: consultarRespuestasProgramaAuditoria(filtros)\n\nC_stats_bp -&gt; API: GET /api/stats/auditoria/respuestas-programa?...\nAPI -&gt; C_stats: respuestasProgramaAuditoria(...)\n\nalt Parámetros faltantes\n  C_stats --&gt; API: 400 Bad Request\n  API --&gt; C_stats_bp: 400\n  C_stats_bp --&gt; VAud: mostrarError(\&quot;Faltan parámetros obligatorios.\&quot;)\nelse Sin datos\n  C_stats -&gt; DB: SELECT COUNT(*) GROUP BY programa\n  DB --&gt; C_stats: vacío\n  C_stats --&gt; API: 204\n  API --&gt; C_stats_bp: 204\n  C_stats_bp --&gt; VAud: mostrarAviso(\&quot;Sin respuestas registradas.\&quot;)\nend\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;format&quot;: &quot;svg&quot;&#xa;}" id="dH2Lb4w-dFLo0ImTIugd-1">
