        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle CU 29 – Archivando documentos (Error)\n\nactor Cliente as C\nboundary \&quot;V_Documentos\&quot; as VDocs\ncontrol \&quot;C_docs_bp (Negocio)\&quot; as C_docs_bp\ncontrol \&quot;C_api (Gateway)\&quot; as API\ncontrol \&quot;C_archive (Backend)\&quot; as C_archive\ndatabase \&quot;PostgreSQL\&quot; as DB\n\nC -&gt; VDocs: archivar(docId)\nVDocs -&gt; C_docs_bp: archivar(docId)\nC_docs_bp -&gt; API: POST /api/docs/{id}/archive\nAPI -&gt; C_archive: archivar(docId, userId)\n\nalt Ya archivado\n  C_archive --&gt; API: 409 Conflict\n  API --&gt; C_docs_bp: 409\n  C_docs_bp --&gt; VDocs: mostrarError(\&quot;El documento ya está archivado.\&quot;)\nelse Sin permisos\n  C_archive --&gt; API: 403\n  API --&gt; C_docs_bp: 403\n  C_docs_bp --&gt; VDocs: mostrarError(\&quot;No tienes permisos para archivar.\&quot;)\nend\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;format&quot;: &quot;svg&quot;&#xa;}" id="PT6rByxdgPqcVDco0u7q-0">
