        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle CU 30 – Comentarios internos de revisión (Error)\n\nactor Supervisor as S\nboundary \&quot;V_Revision\&quot; as VRev\ncontrol \&quot;C_review_bp (Negocio)\&quot; as C_review_bp\ncontrol \&quot;C_api (Gateway)\&quot; as API\ncontrol \&quot;C_review (Backend)\&quot; as C_review\ndatabase \&quot;PostgreSQL\&quot; as DB\n\nS -&gt; VRev: agregarComentarioInterno(texto)\nVRev -&gt; C_review_bp: agregarInterno(docId, texto)\n\nalt Rol no autorizado\n  C_review_bp --&gt; VRev: mostrarError(\&quot;Solo supervisores pueden comentar internamente.\&quot;)\n  return\nelse OK\nend\n\nC_review_bp -&gt; API: POST /api/review/{id}/internal-comments\nAPI -&gt; C_review: agregarInterno(...)\n\nalt Documento no en revisión\n  C_review --&gt; API: 412 Precondition Failed\n  API --&gt; C_review_bp: 412\n  C_review_bp --&gt; VRev: mostrarError(\&quot;El documento no está en estado &#39;En revisión&#39;.\&quot;)\nelse Error DB\n  C_review -&gt; DB: INSERT comentario_interno\n  DB --&gt; C_review: ERROR\n  C_review --&gt; API: 500\n  API --&gt; C_review_bp: 500\n  C_review_bp --&gt; VRev: mostrarError(\&quot;No se pudo guardar el comentario interno.\&quot;)\nend\n\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;format&quot;: &quot;svg&quot;&#xa;}" id="aen_BcbLr7MMlJXHypQI-0">
