        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle CU 31 – Eliminando temporalmente (papelera) (Error)\n\nactor Cliente as C\nboundary \&quot;V_Documentos\&quot; as VDocs\ncontrol \&quot;C_docs_bp (Negocio)\&quot; as C_docs_bp\ncontrol \&quot;C_api (Gateway)\&quot; as API\ncontrol \&quot;C_trash (Backend)\&quot; as C_trash\ndatabase \&quot;PostgreSQL\&quot; as DB\n\nC -&gt; VDocs: moverAPapelera(docId)\nVDocs -&gt; C_docs_bp: moverAPapelera(docId)\nC_docs_bp -&gt; API: POST /api/docs/{id}/trash\nAPI -&gt; C_trash: mover(docId, userId)\n\nalt Sin permisos\n  C_trash --&gt; API: 403\n  API --&gt; C_docs_bp: 403\n  C_docs_bp --&gt; VDocs: mostrarError(\&quot;No autorizado para mover a papelera.\&quot;)\nelse Estado incompatible\n  C_trash -&gt; DB: UPDATE ... estado=&#39;PAPELERA&#39;\n  DB --&gt; C_trash: 409 Conflict\n  C_trash --&gt; API: 409\n  API --&gt; C_docs_bp: 409\n  C_docs_bp --&gt; VDocs: mostrarError(\&quot;El documento no puede moverse a papelera desde su estado actual.\&quot;)\nend\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;format&quot;: &quot;svg&quot;&#xa;}" id="5omMUwmzn1y1HiLCW-6C-1">
