        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle CU 37 – Marcando prioridad (Error)\n\nactor Cliente as C\nboundary \&quot;V_Documento\&quot; as VDoc\ncontrol \&quot;C_docs_bp (Negocio)\&quot; as C_docs_bp\ncontrol \&quot;C_api (Gateway)\&quot; as API\ncontrol \&quot;C_priority (Backend)\&quot; as C_priority\ndatabase \&quot;PostgreSQL\&quot; as DB\n\nC -&gt; VDoc: marcarPrioridad(&#39;UltraAlta&#39;)\nVDoc -&gt; C_docs_bp: setPrioridad(docId, nivel)\n\nalt Nivel inválido\n  C_docs_bp --&gt; VDoc: mostrarError(\&quot;Nivel de prioridad no válido.\&quot;)\n  return\nelse OK\nend\n\nC_docs_bp -&gt; API: POST /api/docs/{id}/priority\nAPI -&gt; C_priority: setPrioridad(...)\n\nalt Sin permisos\n  C_priority --&gt; API: 403\n  API --&gt; C_docs_bp: 403\n  C_docs_bp --&gt; VDoc: mostrarError(\&quot;No tienes permisos para cambiar la prioridad.\&quot;)\nelse Error DB\n  C_priority -&gt; DB: UPDATE documentos SET prioridad=...\n  DB --&gt; C_priority: ERROR\n  C_priority --&gt; API: 500\n  API --&gt; C_docs_bp: 500\n  C_docs_bp --&gt; VDoc: mostrarError(\&quot;No se pudo actualizar la prioridad.\&quot;)\nend\n\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;format&quot;: &quot;svg&quot;&#xa;}" id="12W3QI05GkAMQBTgJ-al-1">
